## The Reality of Modern Bug Bounty Hunting
Most high-paying bug bounties are not awarded for just finding a single SQLi or RCE. They are awarded for Exploit Chaining:

[Step 1: SSRF Bug] ──> [Step 2: Access Internal Network] ──> [Step 3: Exploit Unauthenticated SQLi] ──> [Step 4: RCE & Full Takeover]

As a hunter, your goal is to find that first weak link, and then use your automated tools to see how deep into the network you can go.
